WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.204 --> 00:00:20.634
Riley downshifted and pedaled hard along the straightaway.

2
00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:29.628
Dirt and mud spattered her in the face, stinging her skin, but all she could see was the trail.

3
00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:33.254
At the end of the straightaway, the track made a hard turn.

4
00:00:33.255 --> 00:00:40.275
Riley hit the turn, her back tire sliding in the dirt and throwing her off balance.

5
00:00:40.276 --> 00:00:47.036
She stood up on the pedals and pulled back with her body, steadying the bike around the curve.

6
00:00:47.037 --> 00:00:52.701
In front of her, the trail took a fast dip down a hill and then traveled upward again.

7
00:00:52.702 --> 00:00:56.115
Riley thought she caught a glimpse of Quinn up ahead.

8
00:00:56.116 --> 00:01:03.680
Quinn had started thirty seconds before Riley, and she'd lost some time, but Riley had lost time too.

9
00:01:03.681 --> 00:01:11.847
"I just have to beat Quinn's overall time," Riley reminded herself. "I don't have to beat her across the finish line."

10
00:01:11.848 --> 00:01:17.521
Still, it would feel wonderful to cross the finish line ahead of Quinn!

11
00:01:17.522 --> 00:01:22.483
There was another straightaway after the hill—it was perfect for a fast sprint.

12
00:01:22.484 --> 00:01:28.071
Riley barreled down the track, her leg muscles burning.

13
00:01:28.072 --> 00:01:33.816
When she got over the hill, Quinn was ahead of her in the distance, but closer now.

14
00:01:33.817 --> 00:01:39.496
"Woo-hoo!" Riley thought. "Watch out, Quinn—here I come!"

15
00:01:39.497 --> 00:01:43.739
Quinn glanced over her shoulder and spotted Riley.

16
00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:50.413
She pedaled furiously and disappeared so fast, Riley was stunned.

17
00:01:50.414 --> 00:01:56.054
She couldn't help being impressed—Quinn sure knew what she was doing on her bike.

18
00:01:56.055 --> 00:02:05.469
"I do too," Riley told herself. She crouched low over the handlebars, pushing herself harder.

19
00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:14.963
Riley took several more curves easily, leaning into them confidently and holding her balance.

20
00:02:14.964 --> 00:02:24.377
A jump was coming up—the final one. She shifted gears, throwing a burst of speed into her bike.

21
00:02:24.378 --> 00:02:32.537
As she approached the jump, she gripped the handlebars and pedaled hard, rising in her seat to balance the bike.

22
00:02:32.538 --> 00:02:38.319
She sailed over the jump in a perfect arc.

23
00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:42.690
"Yes!" she hollered with delight.

24
00:02:42.691 --> 00:02:50.262
Her wheels landed together with a satisfying thump, and then Riley was pedaling furiously again.

25
00:02:50.263 --> 00:02:56.591
Soon she was closing the gap again, drawing closer to Quinn.

26
00:02:56.592 --> 00:03:03.507
As Riley pulled closer, she thought she saw Quinn's back wheel was wobbling.

27
00:03:03.508 --> 00:03:07.663
"Yikes," Riley thought. "That could be dangerous."

28
00:03:07.664 --> 00:03:12.592
"Go!" People standing on the sidelines roared at the girls.

29
00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:17.989
"Keep up your speed, Riley!" somebody yelled. "Focus!"

30
00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:31.240
Quinn stood up on her bike, and with a last burst of speed, pulled way ahead of Riley. Riley stood up too, pumping hard.

31
00:03:31.241 --> 00:03:42.399
Minutes later the two riders zipped toward the finish line. Quinn crossed first, with Riley following seconds later.

32
00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:51.288
Riley hadn't beaten Quinn over the finish line, but she'd scored one important victory—a better time than Quinn's!

33
00:03:51.289 --> 00:03:54.086
"I did it!" she thought.

34
00:03:54.087 --> 00:04:01.115
Riley crossed her fingers, hoping that her ride had also been good enough to beat all the other girls in the junior division.

35
00:04:01.116 --> 00:04:10.354
Quinn had turned off the track and thrown her bike down. Now she was collapsed on the grass.

36
00:04:10.355 --> 00:04:18.521
Riley rode straight to her parents and Jordan, who was doing her best to jump and clap while on crutches.

37
00:04:18.522 --> 00:04:24.941
Riley dropped her bike, and Jordan grabbed her in a crushing hug.

38
00:04:24.942 --> 00:04:31.354
"I knew you could nail those jumps!" Jordan kept yelling. "What a great ride!"

39
00:04:31.355 --> 00:04:38.337
"I should have made that one jump," Riley said after her sister and parents had stopped congratulating her.

40
00:04:38.338 --> 00:04:45.916
"But I had a really good fall—just like you taught me, Jordan—and that helped me stay in the race."

41
00:04:45.917 --> 00:04:55.418
Delaney came over to high-five Riley. "Way to go," he said. "You were awesome."

42
00:04:55.419 --> 00:05:05.070
Coach Adams joined them. "Nice run, Riley!" he said. "I'm especially impressed at your recovery from that fall."

43
00:05:05.071 --> 00:05:10.403
"Thanks," Riley replied. "I was pretty worried there for a second."

44
00:05:10.404 --> 00:05:17.736
"Well, you should be proud of your ride," Coach Adams said. "You showed a lot of guts and determination on the track."

45
00:05:17.737 --> 00:05:22.901
"I'll be prouder of my ride if I make the team," Riley said, grinning.

46
00:05:22.902 --> 00:05:31.646
"We'll see," Coach replied. "We'll announce the new team members after all the riders have finished their tryouts."

47
00:05:31.647 --> 00:05:40.528
While everyone waited for the last riders to finish, Riley went over to the grassy spot and dropped down beside Quinn.

48
00:05:40.529 --> 00:05:44.294
The other girl hadn't moved since she finished her ride.

49
00:05:44.295 --> 00:05:50.126
Quinn looked at her. "What do you want?" she asked in a tired voice.

50
00:05:50.127 --> 00:05:59.526
"To congratulate you," Riley said. "That was a fantastic ride. And you made a really nice recovery from that fall."

51
00:05:59.527 --> 00:06:04.779
Quinn narrowed her eyes suspiciously. "I doubt I made the team."

52
00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:12.699
Riley shrugged. "We'll see, but I think you and I are going to be junior Blue Demons."

53
00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:20.014
"I'm not so sure about me," Quinn mumbled. "But you had a really strong ride."

54
00:06:20.015 --> 00:06:27.936
"Thanks," Riley said. "How did you fall behind before that big jump? Did something happen on the track?"

55
00:06:27.937 --> 00:06:35.411
Quinn closed her eyes, sighing. "If I tell you, you'll just mock me for being a stupid snob."

56
00:06:35.412 --> 00:06:39.513
"No, I won't," Riley said. "Why would I do that?"

57
00:06:39.514 --> 00:06:47.512
"Because my fabulous, custom-designed bike has a fatal flaw," Quinn went on. "Its dumb rider."

58
00:06:47.513 --> 00:06:50.029
Riley was confused. "Huh?"

59
00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.915
Quinn looked away.

60
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:59.143
"I was so sure my bike was perfect that I didn't bother doing a pre-race check. Some of the bolts were loose."

61
00:06:59.144 --> 00:07:04.133
"Oh . . ." Riley murmured. "That was pretty dumb, Quinn."

62
00:07:04.134 --> 00:07:10.315
"My bike felt strange when I started," Quinn went on, "but I thought it was the soft track.

63
00:07:10.316 --> 00:07:13.543
When I went over the first jumps, I realized what was happening.

64
00:07:13.544 --> 00:07:17.807
I was afraid if I hit that big jump too hard, something would fall off.

65
00:07:17.808 --> 00:07:21.299
That was what distracted me when I reached the tricky jump."

66
00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:26.555
"You're lucky," Riley said. "You could have had a bad accident."

67
00:07:26.556 --> 00:07:34.392
"I know. While you were chasing me, I kept thinking that my bike was about to fall apart." Quinn laughed.

68
00:07:34.393 --> 00:07:36.954
"But I still wanted to beat you."

69
00:07:36.955 --> 00:07:43.532
Riley was curious about something. "Why did you use the fall I showed you?"

70
00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:48.928
Quinn shrugged. "Because your way of falling doesn't knock down living room lamps."

71
00:07:48.929 --> 00:07:52.929
Riley grinned. "Or break as many bones!"

72
00:07:52.930 --> 00:08:00.591
Soon the last rider in all the divisions crossed the finish line. Riley jumped to her feet.

73
00:08:00.592 --> 00:08:07.257
"Come on, Quinn!" she said eagerly. "Coach Adams is finally going to announce the new team!"

74
00:08:07.258 --> 00:08:15.185
Quinn held up crossed fingers. "I don't have much hope, but maybe it'll be you and me in the junior division."

75
00:08:15.186 --> 00:08:23.283
"I think it will be!" Riley replied.
